Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.61,0:00:03.56,Default,Pyrz,0,0,0,,Y-Y-Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.56,0:00:06.36,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,I-I thought you were bedridden!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.36,0:00:10.51,Default,King,0,0,0,,Mia, your sister's medicine \Nis truly incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.51,0:00:11.82,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Thank you, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.82,0:00:13.86,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Y-You've got it all wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.31,0:00:15.66,Default,Guard,0,0,0,,I have a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.66,0:00:20.37,Default,Guard,0,0,0,,We found a poison at the Adenauer residence\N identical to the one used here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:23.26,Default,Guard,0,0,0,,It was apparently furnished by Marquis Pyrz.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.79,0:00:27.13,Default,King,0,0,0,,Pyrz. Have you anything \Nto say in your defense?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.87,0:00:31.01,Default,Pyrz,0,0,0,,N-No, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:32.37,Default,King,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.87,0:00:36.67,Default,King,0,0,0,,Arrest Marquis and Marquise Adenauer,\N as well as Marquis Pyrz
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.67,0:00:40.39,Default,King,0,0,0,,and anyone else involved \Nin this plot at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.69,0:00:45.23,Default,King,0,0,0,,That goes for all who neglected \Ntheir duties in my absence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.51,0:00:51.98,Default,King,0,0,0,,I've already received accounts, documents, \Nand testimony proving all your wrongdoing,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.98,0:00:54.36,Default,King,0,0,0,,including the attempt on my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.87,0:00:57.97,Default,King,0,0,0,,Do you understand what this means, Pyrz?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.17,0:00:59.91,Default,Pyrz,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.35,0:01:05.16,Default,King,0,0,0,,Your own son pleaded with me to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.07,0:01:07.89,Default,King,0,0,0,,As for you, Julius...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.54,0:01:09.67,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,F-Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.67,0:01:15.09,Default,King,0,0,0,,I've seen all of your irredeemable behavior,\Nincluding your attempt on your brother's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.09,0:01:16.89,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,F-Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.89,0:01:18.07,Default,King,0,0,0,,Take him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.07,0:01:18.72,Default,Guards,0,0,0,,Yes, sire!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:21.94,Main - Top,Julius,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop! Unhand me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.16,0:01:23.35,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}And so Julius's havoc comes to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.35,0:01:28.23,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}The groundwork to face the monsters \Nunder the king's leadership is finally laid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.89,0:01:33.96,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}The battle for Girtonia's very existence
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.84,0:01:36.38,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}is about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.03,0:02:00.91,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(710,1)\blur4\t(1,710,\blur0)\an8\fnGeorgia\b1\fs18\shad0\bord0\c&HDA8FA9&}The Too-Perfect Saint: Tossed Aside\Nby My Fiancé and Sold to Another Kingdom
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.91,0:02:00.91,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(960,1)\an8\fnGeorgia\b1\fs18\shad0\bord0\c&H884FD9&\3c&HFCFEFE&}The Too-Perfect Saint{\c&H9B9999&}: {\c&HDEC58D&}Tossed {\c&HDDBF93&}Aside\N{\c&HE2B99A&}by {\c&HC8ACAD&}My {\c&HDDB3B4&}Fiancé {\c&HDCBAC3&}and {\c&HD79BB3&}Sold {\c&HCEA8CE&}to {\c&HD4A8D5&}Another {\c&HC3A8E2&}Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.35,0:03:11.42,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,1)\shad1\bord0\fnGeorgia\fs10\c&HF9F8FA&\3c&H4E4E4E&\4c&H252526&\pos(532,283.044)}Episode 10\N"What I Wish to {\c&H9CE970&\fs12}Protect"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:12.71,Main - Top,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Himari reports that our knights\Nhave been allowed entry into Girtonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.71,0:03:15.79,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're fighting monsters by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.79,0:03:18.91,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Granted, this delay was a huge setback.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.91,0:03:20.51,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I hope they made it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.83,0:03:21.97,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,Philia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.13,0:03:24.89,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,You should prepare yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.89,0:03:27.83,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Brother, what do you—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.09,0:03:29.10,Main - Top,Grace,0,0,0,,Saint Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.10,0:03:31.06,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,I have returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.52,0:03:34.36,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Grace. Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.82,0:03:36.94,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,Your idea worked, Saint Philia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.94,0:03:42.78,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,I've made it so you can use this gem\Nto gather mana from me and my three sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.24,0:03:44.91,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.53,0:03:49.13,Main - Italics,Philia,0,0,0,,The ancient ritual known \Nas the magic-conversion spell
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.13,0:03:53.42,Main - Italics,Philia,0,0,0,,concentrates the magical power \Nof several people within a magistone
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.42,0:03:58.45,Main - Italics,Philia,0,0,0,,and imbues that magic into whoever wears it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.45,0:04:01.80,Main - Italics,Philia,0,0,0,,artificially allowing them \Nto bring massive power to bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:05.19,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Grace, I can't thank you \Nenough for what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.19,0:04:07.26,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,No need to thank me at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.87,0:04:11.39,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,Now, Saint Philia, bring our magic together!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.84,0:04:14.01,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Yes, let us begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.96,0:04:17.77,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I'm expanding the Great Purification\NCircle over the continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.24,0:04:22.71,Default,Emily,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.71,0:04:26.23,Default,Emily,0,0,0,,Show me what you can do, Philia Adenauer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.68,0:04:32.75,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.27,0:04:42.07,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,The mana is shining?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.07,0:04:44.01,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,This is way brighter than last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.71,0:04:48.24,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}With the magic power of five people \Nstretched to its limit, this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.05,0:04:49.85,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:57.40,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,Saint Philia! This is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.40,0:04:59.15,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,It's really expanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.15,0:05:01.32,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I-Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.32,0:05:05.66,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,Its purifying power is reaching\N toward Bolmern!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.66,0:05:07.36,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.13,0:05:13.04,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,Saint Philia! Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.04,0:05:15.76,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Is Girtonia saved now, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:19.00,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,No, I'm afraid...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.36,0:05:20.57,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,You failed, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.34,0:05:24.16,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.16,0:05:27.51,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,The circle only covered\Nthe western half of the continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.90,0:05:32.31,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,The magic didn't convey properly \Nin Girtonia's direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.72,0:05:33.96,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,You mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.96,0:05:36.52,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,Our magic power wasn't enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.87,0:05:39.83,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,No, it was more than enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.83,0:05:44.49,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,But the mana to the east is far more \Ndisrupted than I anticipated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.49,0:05:47.61,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,It prevented the circle's expansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.33,0:05:49.62,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.75,0:05:52.12,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.84,0:05:53.83,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.36,0:05:57.34,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}This was supposed to be\N the best way to help them...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.34,0:06:01.00,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to save Mia, and yet... \NEvery second counts, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.64,0:06:07.09,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,The only way now... I'd have to put up \Na pillar of light in Girtonia myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:09.51,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.78,0:06:11.97,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,If you leave the capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.97,0:06:15.04,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,the Great Purification Circle\N breaks down, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:17.39,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,That's awful! Isn't there another way?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.72,0:06:19.70,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Grace!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.70,0:06:20.85,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.85,0:06:24.83,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Our magical power is linked now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.83,0:06:27.53,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,If you take over at the core for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.11,0:06:30.95,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I would be able to go off on my own...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.83,0:06:36.41,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}But that wouldn't be appropriate \Nfor Parnacorta's saint.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.80,0:06:37.96,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,Saint Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.96,0:06:39.56,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,You have to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.56,0:06:41.33,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,Let me handle things here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.33,0:06:44.42,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Yeah, if you can go, \Nthere's no reason not to!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.75,0:06:47.63,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Grace... Prince Osvalt...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.63,0:06:50.66,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,No, I cannot allow you to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.66,0:06:51.76,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.76,0:06:54.22,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,I know you're smart enough to understand why.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.79,0:06:59.61,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,I cannot let Parnacorta's saint\Nintervene in another kingdom's crisis
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.61,0:07:03.10,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,and endanger herself in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.41,0:07:08.61,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,And given the failure of the Great \NPurification Circle's expansion,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.61,0:07:11.91,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,I'll have to withdraw our knights \Nwhen the time comes as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.91,0:07:13.40,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,But Brother—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.17,0:07:17.12,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,I sympathize with the\NKingdom of Girtonia's plight,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.12,0:07:20.64,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,and I recognize that Philia \Nfeels obligated to her sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.64,0:07:24.12,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,But even if this means you resent me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.12,0:07:26.38,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,I must act in the interests of my kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.38,0:07:29.74,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,and prioritize the safety \Nand future of our people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.74,0:07:33.89,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,Therefore, I must order \Nyou to abandon the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.89,0:07:36.40,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,I agree with the prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.40,0:07:38.22,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,C'mon, Big Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.22,0:07:41.54,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Even if you tried to go now,\N it would be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.54,0:07:45.65,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Girtonia will be smothered \Nbeneath the Demon Realm's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:50.98,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,The rebirth of Archdemon Asmodeus \Nis all but inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.98,0:07:54.62,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,We can't simply let you charge \Ninto such a situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.62,0:08:02.00,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Good ol' Asmodeus {\i1}is{\i0} after the soul \Nof the legendary saint inside you, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.25,0:08:04.08,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Miss Greatest...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.08,0:08:06.38,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Rather, Philia Adenauer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.75,0:08:11.11,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,If we lose you, the Great \NPurification Circle will shatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.11,0:08:14.68,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,The whole world will fall instantly \Nunder the Demon Realm's control.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.76,0:08:17.65,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.45,0:08:21.33,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}The course of action I suggested would mean
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.33,0:08:24.69,Main - Italics,Philia,0,0,0,,abandoning my post as the saint of Parnacorta.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.24,0:08:28.61,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}But... But if I don't do it, Mia's going to...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.61,0:08:29.98,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Miss Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.63,0:08:32.06,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Prince Osvalt?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.52,0:08:37.39,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Don't shoulder this burden alone.\NTake a look around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.39,0:08:38.43,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Remember me saying that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.10,0:08:40.74,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,There's what my father told you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.20,0:08:44.79,Flashback,Eigelstein,0,0,0,,I recommend that you become more selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.79,0:08:48.42,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,What is it {\i1}you{\i0} want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.04,0:08:52.39,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,What's right or wrong \Nisn't important right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.13,0:08:56.51,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Search deep inside you \Nand tell me what you really want!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.21,0:09:00.93,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know exactly what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:04.00,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to save Mia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:06.85,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I just... want to save my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.39,0:09:10.07,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Mia...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.65,0:09:12.43,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I want to save Mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.43,0:09:14.47,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I don't care what happens to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.47,0:09:16.45,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I want to save my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.17,0:09:20.22,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.22,0:09:21.78,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I'll get you where you need to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.64,0:09:27.00,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,Wait a minute! Do you realize \Nwhat you're about to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.00,0:09:29.38,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,You'll be riding to your deaths!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.36,0:09:31.25,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.25,0:09:35.13,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to lose\N my own brother this time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.13,0:09:36.47,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.01,0:09:38.89,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I'm going so you don't have to lose anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.77,0:09:43.81,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.81,0:09:44.55,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Miss Philia?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.55,0:09:45.71,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.71,0:09:47.22,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Grace, please—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.22,0:09:48.60,Default,Grace,0,0,0,,I have it all handled!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.26,0:09:51.28,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.26,0:09:51.28,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.23,0:09:54.15,Default,Philia/Osvalt,0,0,0,,We will return!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.08,0:10:01.12,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Think we should stop 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.66,0:10:05.00,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,They seem pretty determined. \NI'm not sure we could.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.32,0:10:07.66,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,Their chances are close to zero,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.24,0:10:11.29,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,but we'll just have to hope\N they save Girtonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.27,0:10:16.50,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Miss Philia, hold on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.50,0:10:17.22,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.72,0:10:19.96,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Onward...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.96,0:10:21.26,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,to Girtonia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.49,0:10:22.97,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\fnGeorgia\b1\fs10\shad0\bord0\c&H884FD9&\pos(323,110)}The Too-Perfect Saint{\c&H9B9999&}: {\c&HDEC58D&}Tossed {\c&HDDBF93&}Aside\N{\c&HE2B99A&}by {\c&HC8ACAD&}My {\c&HDDB3B4&}Fiancé {\c&HDCBAC3&}and {\c&HD79BB3&}Sold {\c&HCEA8CE&}to {\c&HD4A8D5&}Another {\c&HC3A8E2&}Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.51,0:10:31.52,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,I won't let you lay a hand on Miss Mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.57,0:10:38.08,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm doing nothing more than\Nbuying us time, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.05,0:10:40.68,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Good. Next—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.80,0:10:51.03,Default,Philip,0,0,0,,All forces, charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.05,0:10:57.30,Default,Pierre,0,0,0,,The Parnacortan knights are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.36,0:11:01.05,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}My sister's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.05,0:11:04.13,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}She trusted me to turn things around
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.13,0:11:07.43,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}and sent this charge on my behalf!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.24,0:11:10.07,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,All right! My next barrier will—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.64,0:11:25.83,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,It's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.44,0:11:32.33,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,{\i1}I sense countless monsters coming \Nfrom the Dark Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.72,0:11:34.42,Default,Hildegarde,0,0,0,,Mia! Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.88,0:11:35.75,Default,Girtonian Knight A,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.58,0:11:37.64,Default,Girtonian Knight A,0,0,0,,Should we just run?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.64,0:11:40.01,Default,Girtonian Knight B,0,0,0,,You idiot! There's nowhere to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.74,0:11:43.24,Main - Italics,Mia,0,0,0,,Run? Run where?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.24,0:11:45.26,Main - Italics,Mia,0,0,0,,To Parnacorta, where my sister is?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.01,0:11:50.35,Main - Italics,Mia,0,0,0,,Yes... that's a nice thought, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.19,0:11:56.82,Flashback,Philia,0,0,0,,If it seems likely something will befall \Nher, take her with you and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.83,0:11:59.47,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is this that moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.43,0:12:19.55,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,{\i1}What did she just...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.18,0:12:22.05,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Miss Mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.09,0:12:26.47,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I could abandon my sainthood, \Nabandon everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.47,0:12:28.44,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}join my sister in the next kingdom over,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.44,0:12:31.13,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}forget everything, and start over!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.13,0:12:34.05,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}How wonderful that would be!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.81,0:12:39.43,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sure she and all her new \Nfriends would welcome me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.43,0:12:42.46,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'd have such a lovely time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.17,0:12:47.61,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Silver Judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.66,0:12:50.60,Default,Philip,0,0,0,,Follow the saint!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.43,0:12:57.25,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}But all that happiness...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.73,0:13:00.15,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}How could I stand it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.83,0:13:05.01,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}After all, the person...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.76,0:13:07.49,Main - Italics,Mia,0,0,0,,least deserving of that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.63,0:13:10.64,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.12,0:13:13.15,Flashback,Fernand,0,0,0,,Pierre.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.15,0:13:16.17,Flashback,Fernand,0,0,0,,If it comes to it, do whatever \Nit takes to stop Mia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.17,0:13:17.73,Flashback,Pierre,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.31,0:13:22.03,Flashback,Fernand,0,0,0,,She hates herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.19,0:13:27.27,Flashback,Fernand,0,0,0,,In despair over what her \Ndear sister was put through,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.27,0:13:30.66,Flashback,Fernand,0,0,0,,she's sworn vengeance\N on everyone responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.44,0:13:32.95,Flashback,Fernand,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.70,0:13:36.71,Default,Pierre,0,0,0,,Saint Mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.40,0:13:41.42,Flashback - Italics,Fernand,0,0,0,,That includes herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.67,0:13:45.59,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.52,0:13:53.56,Flashback - Italics,Fernand,0,0,0,,She will use the fulfillment \Nof her saintly duties to punish herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.14,0:13:57.23,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,This will be the day that I die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.10,0:14:02.84,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,If we ride up this way, \Nwe'll come to a plateau.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.84,0:14:06.69,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I'll create a pillar there and expand \Nthe Great Purification Circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.69,0:14:07.40,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.92,0:14:10.32,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mia, let me be in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.32,0:14:13.66,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Silver Judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.28,0:14:21.00,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm out of magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.52,0:14:25.63,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}A saint without magic is just a burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.28,0:14:30.20,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}But if I'm out, I can just make more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.20,0:14:34.40,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll burn my life's energy \Nand convert it to magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.40,0:14:36.02,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a forbidden technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.52,0:14:41.02,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}But if it will let me protect \Nas many people as possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.93,0:14:43.65,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.59,0:14:48.53,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Judgment Arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.15,0:14:51.34,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Begone! Begone! Begone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.34,0:14:53.57,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Begone, begone, begone, begone, begone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.57,0:14:55.02,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Begone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.02,0:14:56.63,Default,Pierre,0,0,0,,S-Saint Mia...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.33,0:14:58.76,Default,Pierre,0,0,0,,This won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.76,0:15:01.52,Default,Pierre,0,0,0,,Nothing good will come of losing her now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.52,0:15:03.16,Default,Pierre,0,0,0,,Protect Saint Mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:05.65,Default,Pierre,0,0,0,,Protect the Kingdom of Girtonia!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.64,0:15:13.26,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm so glad... I was able\N to act as a saint one last time...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:19.63,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.63,0:15:23.58,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is it over now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.52,0:15:32.86,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's dark. I'm so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.86,0:15:35.83,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I feel so sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.10,0:15:39.06,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I did work really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.84,0:15:42.12,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I suppose I've earned some rest now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.42,0:15:48.36,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Mia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.52,0:15:52.59,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Someone's calling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.59,0:15:54.59,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.17,0:16:00.85,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh... it's my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.85,0:16:02.86,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}She came for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.86,0:16:05.86,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll all be safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.90,0:16:11.24,Default,Pierre,0,0,0,,Saint Mia! Saint Mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.24,0:16:15.32,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Silver Judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.84,0:16:24.87,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.16,0:16:28.88,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}See? Just like I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.99,0:16:33.48,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}After all, my sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.34,0:16:40.40,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}is my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.42,0:16:44.42,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,The monsters have been weakened!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.42,0:16:46.27,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Take this chance to slay them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.12,0:16:51.03,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Saint Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.46,0:16:53.43,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Prince Osvalt!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.43,0:16:55.03,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.75,0:16:58.03,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Miss Lena? Sir Leonardo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.94,0:17:00.41,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Saint Heal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.73,0:17:02.41,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,How's it look?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.06,0:17:05.83,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I'll save her. I swear I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.07,0:17:09.04,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Her heartbeat is weakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.33,0:17:11.61,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Adjust her circulation...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.61,0:17:13.14,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Saint Heal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.10,0:17:17.59,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Wake up, Mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.91,0:17:19.47,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Her wounds are healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.47,0:17:22.60,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now it's up to her to stay strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.53,0:17:26.27,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm scared. I can't stop shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.85,0:17:30.36,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}What if she doesn't wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.21,0:17:35.61,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Miss Philia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.89,0:17:42.30,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I won't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.23,0:17:45.62,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I will save you, Mia...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.17,0:17:49.83,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Because I'm your big sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.88,0:17:52.38,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Saint...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.38,0:17:54.33,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Heal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.55,0:18:00.39,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,S...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.37,0:18:03.52,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Mia?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.52,0:18:06.01,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,S-Sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.91,0:18:13.70,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,M-Mia...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.38,0:18:16.62,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Thank goodness you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.79,0:18:19.41,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,So warm...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.97,0:18:25.91,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I thought I'd never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.47,0:18:31.99,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Because you're so determined \Nto fulfill your saintly duties,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.67,0:18:34.42,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.86,0:18:36.36,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.36,0:18:39.40,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,But I'm not acting as a saint right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.40,0:18:43.18,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I'm acting as your sister, \Nso I couldn't leave you behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.63,0:18:48.94,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Even if it wasn't the right decision,\NI had to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.99,0:18:52.44,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.44,0:18:55.40,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,When you left for Parnacorta,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.40,0:19:00.20,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I was so sad, so lonely, \NI thought I might go crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.05,0:19:03.70,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,But more than anything, I was angry...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.18,0:19:07.29,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,at everyone who took you for granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.82,0:19:10.62,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I wanted to take revenge on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.92,0:19:16.30,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Sister, I'm sorry I didn't see it all sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.59,0:19:25.16,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Thank you for being angry on my behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.90,0:19:31.18,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,No one could have saved this kingdom but you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.79,0:19:35.35,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,You're a true saint now, Mia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.04,0:19:40.68,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Philia...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.23,0:19:47.62,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Say, Big Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.62,0:19:50.84,Default,Mammon,0,0,0,,Guess we were right not \Nto stop her from coming, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.84,0:19:52.94,Default,Erza,0,0,0,,She just got lucky. Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.37,0:20:04.38,Default,Guard A,0,0,0,,Prince Julius escaped?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.38,0:20:07.04,Default,Guard B,0,0,0,,He can't have gone far! Find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.40,0:20:12.67,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,D-D-Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:15.51,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,I won't let this be the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.51,0:20:18.78,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,If I can just get the power...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.07,0:20:21.70,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.70,0:20:23.97,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Just you wait, Mia...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.97,0:20:28.83,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,I'll show you what happens \Nto those who betray me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.22,0:20:33.49,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Now give me power!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.49,0:20:35.71,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well done,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.71,0:20:38.67,Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,{\i1}prince of Girtonia!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.43,0:20:49.81,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd be back here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.81,0:20:53.69,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Miss Philia, we managed to avoid\N the worst-case scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.69,0:20:56.28,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Yes, we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.28,0:20:58.69,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,But only thanks to your aid, Prince Osvalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.69,0:21:00.34,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.34,0:21:02.03,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.03,0:21:03.71,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,You're the amazing one, Miss Philia.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.71,0:21:05.59,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Oh, hardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.59,0:21:09.37,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I never would have made it this far \Nwithout your encouragement.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.24,0:21:15.07,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I've never seen you this friendly \Nwith a man before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.85,0:21:19.04,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I never dreamed you'd find \Na sweetheart over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.36,0:21:20.49,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Sweetheart?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.98,0:21:23.79,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Mia, don't insinuate things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.79,0:21:26.16,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,You're bothering Prince Osvalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.16,0:21:29.05,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Well, I wouldn't call it a bother, exactly...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.94,0:21:33.81,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Too bad. I like him way better \Nthan our louse of a prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.53,0:21:37.31,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,But I'm just glad you seem happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.17,0:21:39.08,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Mia...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.51,0:21:43.82,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Your Majesty! Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.40,0:21:51.58,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Hello, Philia, my destined one...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.94,0:21:54.95,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,We meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.87,0:23:32.63,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Too-Perfect Saint: Tossed Aside \Nby My Fiancé and Sold to Another Kingdom{\i0}.
